sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Candidate
    participant Next as Next.js (Server Action)
    participant DB as Supabase
    participant AI as OpenAI (GPT-4)
    participant Retell as Retell AI

    Note over U, Next: Post-Interview Analysis

    U->>Next: Request Analytics (Call ID)
    activate Next
    
    Next->>DB: Get Response & Transcript (by Call ID)
    DB-->>Next: Returns Transcript
    
    Next->>DB: Get Interview Questions
    DB-->>Next: Returns Questions
    
    Note over Next: Construct System Prompt
    
    Next->>AI: Send Transcript + Prompts
    activate AI
    AI-->>Next: Return JSON Analysis
    deactivate AI
    
    Next->>DB: Update Response (Save Analytics)
    
    Next-->>U: Return Analytics Data
    deactivate Next
